{"id":2186,"date":"2024-11-17T22:59:49","date_gmt":"2024-11-17T14:59:49","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wordpress\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2186"},"modified":"2024-11-24T20:17:47","modified_gmt":"2024-11-24T12:17:47","slug":"fms-filter-bags","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=fms-filter-bags","title":{"rendered":"FMS Filter Bags"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"product-post\" data-elementor-id=\"2186\" class=\"elementor elementor-2186\" data-elementor-post-type=\"product\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-618b5a52 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"618b5a52\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78acde75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"78acde75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>About FMS Filter Bags<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Materials<\/strong>: FMS filter bags are often made from materials like polyester, polypropylene, aramid (Nomex), or other specialized fibers depending on the application\u2019s temperature and chemical requirements.<\/li><li><strong>Efficiency<\/strong>: These filter bags are designed to provide high filtration efficiency, capturing fine particles and ensuring clean air or fluid output.<\/li><li><strong>Design<\/strong>: They come in various designs, including different shapes, sizes, and types of closures (snap bands, rings, etc.), to fit different types of baghouses or filtration systems.<\/li><li><strong>Temperature Resistance<\/strong>: Depending on the material, FMS filter bags can withstand varying temperature ranges, making them suitable for different industrial environments.<\/li><li><strong>Chemical Resistance<\/strong>: Some FMS filter bags are treated or made from materials that offer resistance to chemicals, ensuring longevity and performance in harsh conditions.<\/li><\/ul><hr \/><h3>VS\u00a0 Fiberglass Felt Filter Bags<\/h3><ul><li>Excellent temperature resistance, up to 260 degrees.<\/li><li>Wear resistance, resistance to winding, and excellent folding resistance.<\/li><li>Significant improvement in mechanical strength.<\/li><li>Initial resistance and reduced running resistance.<\/li><li>Filtration efficiency is improved.<\/li><li>Filter wind speed increase.<\/li><li>Significantly improved service life.<\/li><li>Adaptability to dust.<\/li><\/ul><hr \/><h3>Specifications<\/h3><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td>Material<\/td><td>Alkali-free glass fiber chopped yarn, aramid, P84.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Weight (g\/\u33a1)<\/td><td>800<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Thickness (mm)<\/td><td>2.6<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Working temperature (instant)<\/td><td>280\u2103<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Working temperature (long-term)<\/td><td>100\uff5e200\u2103<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Breaking strength (warp)<\/td><td>400N\/5\u00d720cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Breaking strength (weft)<\/td><td>1600N\/5\u00d720cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Diameter size (mm)<\/td><td>100, 125, 130, 150, 18, 250, ect.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Filter precision (\u00b5m)<\/td><td>5, 10, 25, 50, 80, 100, 150, 200, 250, 300, 400, 600, 800, 1,000, 1,250.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Acidity<\/td><td>Excellent<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Alkalinity<\/td><td>Excellent<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Breathability (m\u00b3\/\u33a1.min)<\/td><td>12\uff5e16<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Post-processing method<\/td><td>Impregnation, drying, lamination, waterproofing.<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3><strong>Post-treatment<\/strong><\/h3><p>For the material of FMS filter bag, we can treat it with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:<\/p><ul><li>PTFE Impregnation.<\/li><li>PTFE Membrane.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d9d648 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3d9d648\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9c79f1 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e9c79f1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ptfe-membrane-FMS-filter-bags-\u8be6\u60c52.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2192\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ptfe-membrane-FMS-filter-bags-\u8be6\u60c52.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ptfe-membrane-FMS-filter-bags-\u8be6\u60c52-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ptfe-membrane-FMS-filter-bags-\u8be6\u60c52-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-582b31b elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"582b31b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Flumes-FMS-Filter-Bags-\u8be6\u60c51.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2191\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Flumes-FMS-Filter-Bags-\u8be6\u60c51.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Flumes-FMS-Filter-Bags-\u8be6\u60c51-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Flumes-FMS-Filter-Bags-\u8be6\u60c51-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a09614 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6a09614\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Philite\u00ae Processing Technology for FMS Filter Bags<\/h3><h4>Filter Bag Mouth<\/h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7cbc927 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7cbc927\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-head-\u8be6\u60c53.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2193\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-head-\u8be6\u60c53.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-head-\u8be6\u60c53-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-head-\u8be6\u60c53-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-794b5d1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"794b5d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>A stainless steel spring ring is installed, the bag head is the external interface, the vertical seam edge and the oblique seam line, and the outer layer is wrapped with filter material.<\/li><\/ul><h4>Filter Bag Body<\/h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f5ca1c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2f5ca1c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-body-02-\u8be6\u60c54.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2194\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-body-02-\u8be6\u60c54.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-body-02-\u8be6\u60c54-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-body-02-\u8be6\u60c54-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ffbe62e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ffbe62e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>The filter bag mouth and the filter bag body are connected with a single single needle thread and two double needle threads.<\/li><li>The bag body is sewn by a filter material crimper with three needles and six threads, the stitch length is 28-35 stitches\/10cm, and the width is 6-9mm.<\/li><li>The bottom material of the bag body should be turned outward and upward and have a 100mm bag bottom reinforcement layer.<\/li><li>The edge material of the reinforcement layer is turned inward and sewn with double needles.<\/li><li>The three-needle seam on the seam surface of the filter bag body should be vertical to the bag mouth without bending.<\/li><\/ul><h4>Filter Bag Bottom<\/h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d2a3e6d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d2a3e6d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-bottom-\u8be6\u60c55.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2195\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-bottom-\u8be6\u60c55.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-bottom-\u8be6\u60c55-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FMS-Filter-Bag-bottom-\u8be6\u60c55-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d94c5a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3d94c5a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>The filter bag body and the filter bag bottom are sewn with double or three needles.<\/li><li>The bottom edge of the bag body and the bag bottom are 10-12mm apart.<\/li><li>The bottom of the bag body can stand upright, and there is a reinforcement layer at the bottom of the filter bag.<\/li><\/ul><h3><strong>Applications<\/strong><\/h3><p>FMS filter bags are widely used in various industries where high temperatures and chemically aggressive dust collection conditions exist, making them a reliable choice for industrial filtration applications. These include air filtration, liquid filtration, petrochemicals, food and beverage production, pharmaceutical industries, electronic manufacturing, and more. They are used to remove different types of pollutants such as dust, smoke, chemicals, microorganisms, and more.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e100289 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e100289\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec34349 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ec34349\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/application-02-\u8be6\u60c56.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2196\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/application-02-\u8be6\u60c56.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/application-02-\u8be6\u60c56-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/application-02-\u8be6\u60c56-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05c3bc1 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"05c3bc1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/application-01-p61.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3023\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/application-01-p61.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/application-01-p61-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/application-01-p61-600x400.jpg 600w\" 